        <mxCell id="n24" value="Evaluated in this study: L0 to L2 (solid). Proposed as future work: L3 to L6 (dashed)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=9;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="56" width="660" height="26" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n25" value="L0 to L2 vary what the system is TOLD about its failure, and produced identical outcomes.&#xa;L3 to L6 vary what the system can DO about it. The one intervention that moved outcomes in this&#xa;study, changing the edit notation, belongs to the second kind." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=9;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="570" width="660" height="60" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
